Subject: Flood Warning issued - River Severn at Upton-upon-Severn

FLOOD WARNING - Flooding is expected. Immediate action required.

Area: River Severn at Upton-upon-Severn, including Waterside, School Lane and
the caravan park at Marina Road.

River levels are rising at the Upton-upon-Severn gauge following persistent
rainfall in the Severn catchment. Levels are expected to exceed 5.2m and peak
between 2200 on 27/01 and 0400 on 28/01. Approximately 210 properties are wit=
hin
the warning area.

Demountable flood barriers are being deployed by the Environment Agency from
1400 today.

This message was sent by the Environment Agency Flood Warning Service.
